<title>USA: U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- May 2.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sunflower Market Weekly Review -- May 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>National Sunflower Summary -- USDA Market News Services.</p>
<p>Prices as of May 2, 1997</p>
<p>Weekly Trends: Sunflower Seeds were mixed, mostly 20 to 40 cents higher.</p>
<p>Sunflower Meal was steady to 10.00 lower, mostly steady.</p>
<p>Sunflower Oil was steady.</p>
